    "prerequisites": "Level 10, Grave Bite or Corpse Slam",
    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>UNLIVING-ZOMBIE</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 10, Grave Bite or Corpse Slam</p>\n<p>Your bite and blows carry the rot that animates you.</p>\n<p>When you inflict a critical injury with your Bite or Slam, the target must attempt a Fortitude save against Zombie Plague. The disease level is equal to your level. A creature can be exposed to your Zombie Plague only once per day.</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a critical injury with Grave Bite or Corpse Slam exposes the target to Zombie Plague at your level (its own Fortitude exposure save), once a day per creature.</p>",
